    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d432">

                <pb facs="0322" n="250" xml:id="pg250"/>

                <head>Municipal Council of Ludlow</head>
                <dateline>
                    <placeName>Ludlow</placeName>, <date
                        ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-document-content" calendar="gregorian"
                        when="1865-05-04">May 4, 1865</date>
                </dateline>
                <p>At the quarterly meeting of the mayor, aldermen and council of the borough of
                    Ludlow, held in council chamber, the 4th day of May, 1865, the following
                    resolution was unanimously agreed to, and it was ordered that the corporate
                    common seal be affixed thereto:</p>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Resolved</hi>, That this council express their sorrow
                    and indignation at the atrocious murder of Abraham Lincoln, the late President
                    of the United States, and record their deep sympathy with the people of the
                    great American nation in the heavy affliction that has befallen them.</p>
                <closer>[<hi rendition="#small-caps">seal</hi>.] <signed>JOHN HARDING, </signed>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mayor</hi>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
